{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39980","headline":"春末道陈先辈之清源 · 徐夤","name":"春末道陈先辈之清源","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫中惟是长年华，每羡君行自叹嗟。\n归日捧持明月宝，去时期刻刺桐花。\n春风避酒多游寺，晓骑听鸡早入衙。\n千乘侯王若相问，飞书与报白云家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}